1
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:18,180
Everything is fated.

2
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,650
Nothing is up to us.

3
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:23,440
Half a life in officialdom,

4
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:25,160
wielding power in my hands,

5
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,560
I'm like a fish in this pond,

6
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:35,640
coddled and fed by those around me.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,700
Yet even should the waters run dry,

8
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:47,190
I shall never allow myself

9
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,960
fall onto the chopping block

10
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:53,640
to be slaughtered.

11
00:02:18,990 --> 00:02:23,860
[Light the Dark]

12
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:26,750
[Episode 5]

13
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:51,000
Come in.

14
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:53,960
Boss.

15
00:03:01,190 --> 00:03:01,840
Boss,

16
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:03,330
this is the list of

17
00:03:03,350 --> 00:03:04,720
all the remaining goods.

18
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:05,780
Please take a look.

19
00:03:09,310 --> 00:03:10,660
Can't you see?

20
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,790
It used to be crowded here,

21
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,090
and there was a line at the door.

22
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,360
We're not one player short anymore.

23
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,970
We need three.

24
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,400
Can't even play the game.

25
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:23,310
Boss,

26
00:03:24,730 --> 00:03:26,329
the Red Dragon is still here.

27
00:03:26,410 --> 00:03:27,640
So, you're still the one

28
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,850
sitting in the center

29
00:03:29,170 --> 00:03:30,970
and controlling the direction.

30
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:33,290
Neither of us is the Red Dragon now.

31
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:36,300
This batch of goods is.

32
00:03:35,370 --> 00:03:36,230
[List of goods]

33
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:38,290
If we don't play it out quickly,

34
00:03:38,290 --> 00:03:39,750
and someone discovers it,

35
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,410
everyone at this mahjong table

36
00:03:41,410 --> 00:03:42,920
will be doomed.

37
00:03:43,850 --> 00:03:45,600
Now everyone at the table

38
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:46,520
is watching.

39
00:03:47,250 --> 00:03:48,120
I'm afraid

40
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:52,300
it's not that easy to back out.

41
00:03:54,970 --> 00:03:56,900
You've been with me for many years,

42
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,920
so you should understand one thing.

43
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,730
Fortune favors the bold.

44
00:04:05,010 --> 00:04:07,340
This time, I won't take
any of these tiles.

45
00:04:08,130 --> 00:04:09,190
They're all yours.

46
00:04:10,330 --> 00:04:11,100
Boss,

47
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,650
that's not what I meant.

48
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,040
These years, you've actually

49
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:15,450
given me a lot.

50
00:04:15,730 --> 00:04:16,850
If it weren't for you,

51
00:04:16,850 --> 00:04:17,730
I'd just be

52
00:04:17,730 --> 00:04:19,040
an ordinary driver.

53
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,560
I'm worried I might let you down

54
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,770
and hold you back.

55
00:04:24,330 --> 00:04:25,120
But since

56
00:04:26,170 --> 00:04:27,630
you still trust me so much,

57
00:04:27,970 --> 00:04:28,770
then fine,

58
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,400
we'll stick to the old rules.

59
00:04:30,850 --> 00:04:32,050
I'll take 30 percent.

60
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,170
I knew I was right about you.

61
00:04:35,170 --> 00:04:36,100
You've got guts.

62
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:38,440
This time, I'll give you 70 percent.

63
00:04:38,730 --> 00:04:39,920
Deal.

64
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:50,860
How's it going?

65
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,950
What do you think?

66
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,250
Those old foxes

67
00:04:55,250 --> 00:04:56,210
under Wan Yang

68
00:04:56,290 --> 00:04:57,520
are really hard to deal with.

69
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:59,650
Team Leader Pan and the investigators

70
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,130
had several talks

71
00:05:01,180 --> 00:05:02,260
with them,

72
00:05:02,750 --> 00:05:05,290
but all of them were evasive
and talking in circles.

73
00:05:05,290 --> 00:05:06,300
And without solid evidence,

74
00:05:06,300 --> 00:05:07,850
the investigation team

75
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:09,200
had to release Wan Yang.

76
00:05:09,490 --> 00:05:10,820
They released Wan Yang?

77
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,180
That secret warehouse Shan found

78
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:15,940
while following Liu Jun

79
00:05:16,530 --> 00:05:18,370
should count as solid evidence, right?

80
00:05:18,370 --> 00:05:20,050
We can follow this lead

81
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:20,830
and keep digging.

82
00:05:20,830 --> 00:05:22,690
I'm afraid this lead is a dead end.

83
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:23,790
They must've found out

84
00:05:23,790 --> 00:05:25,160
the investigation team came.

85
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:27,360
They probably transferred it long ago.

86
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:28,570
Ying,

87
00:05:28,690 --> 00:05:29,300
you should first

88
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:30,500
look for clues

89
00:05:30,530 --> 00:05:31,860
in those account books.

90
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,330
Come here.

91
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:42,970
These are the parts receipts
for the past five years.

92
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:44,740
I found that

93
00:05:45,770 --> 00:05:47,090
just the falsified scrap reports

94
00:05:47,090 --> 00:05:47,850
alone

95
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,140
have cost our plant

96
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:50,700
800,000 yuan in losses.

97
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:52,780
800,000 yuan?

98
00:05:53,890 --> 00:05:54,730
How much does an ordinary family

99
00:05:54,730 --> 00:05:55,800
spend on food and clothing

100
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,770
in a year?

101
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,050
That's too corrupt!

102
00:05:58,550 --> 00:05:59,990
But these receipts

103
00:06:00,020 --> 00:06:01,680
aren't enough to be evidence.

104
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:04,400
Based on my memory,

105
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,670
I sorted out the years of the parts

106
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:07,570
on the supply department's delivery notes.

107
00:06:07,570 --> 00:06:09,960
Then I compared them
and found the problem.

108
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:10,920
But on the surface,

109
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,950
the account book

110
00:06:11,970 --> 00:06:13,490
is totally clean.

111
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,390
The investigation team

112
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:16,390
might not be able to audit anything.

113
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:19,290
We must find the real account book

114
00:06:19,620 --> 00:06:21,180
to prove their crimes.

115
00:06:25,180 --> 00:06:27,040
You want to find the account book?

116
00:06:28,170 --> 00:06:28,970
They probably keep that thing

117
00:06:28,970 --> 00:06:30,480
on them even when they sleep.

118
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,610
Where can we find it?

119
00:06:36,300 --> 00:06:37,230
Follow Wan Yang.

120
00:06:38,070 --> 00:06:39,730
We'll definitely find clues.

121
00:06:40,170 --> 00:06:40,970
As for you,

122
00:06:40,990 --> 00:06:42,159
stay at home.

123
00:06:42,180 --> 00:06:43,240
Don't go anywhere.

124
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:44,530
-Ying
-Be good.

125
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,290
Shan.

126
00:06:52,290 --> 00:06:53,120
Got it.

127
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:15,770
Take a look at the toys.
Buy two, get one free.

128
00:07:23,470 --> 00:07:25,670
Liu Hong just went in.

129
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,980
Look, for this shipment,

130
00:07:34,970 --> 00:07:36,340
can you let Sun Jie

131
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,800
take Jun with him?

132
00:07:38,090 --> 00:07:39,120
Sun Jie was trained

133
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,210
by you.

134
00:07:40,890 --> 00:07:41,650
If Jun

135
00:07:41,650 --> 00:07:42,680
works with him,

136
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:44,650
he can also learn some of your skills.

137
00:07:44,650 --> 00:07:46,310
You can ask for anything else.

138
00:07:46,650 --> 00:07:48,650
Don't you know how dangerous

139
00:07:48,650 --> 00:07:49,650
this shipment is?

140
00:07:50,170 --> 00:07:50,970
Sun...

141
00:07:58,090 --> 00:07:59,620
Even Sun Jie chickened out.

142
00:07:59,970 --> 00:08:01,880
I promised him 70 percent, and that's why

143
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:03,480
he dared to take the mission.

144
00:08:04,250 --> 00:08:05,060
70 percent?

145
00:08:05,100 --> 00:08:05,770
Don't yell.

146
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,480
Yes, we didn't get Jun

147
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,800
involved in many things.

148
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,680
But you've given him

149
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,210
too little.

150
00:08:11,410 --> 00:08:13,340
You're giving an outsider so much.

151
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,540
This outsider can risk his life for me.

152
00:08:14,540 --> 00:08:15,310
Can Jun do it?

153
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,170
He's a useless man,

154
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:20,100
and you're protecting him
like he's a treasure.

155
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,170
You think I don't know?

156
00:08:22,850 --> 00:08:23,560
Haven't you given him

157
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,820
money from our family?

158
00:08:25,890 --> 00:08:27,210
Besides, the money he's made in the plant

159
00:08:27,210 --> 00:08:28,240
over the past few years

160
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,770
is enough for him to live on.

161
00:08:30,170 --> 00:08:31,170
Believe it or not,

162
00:08:31,330 --> 00:08:32,409
if you give him 30,000 yuan today,

163
00:08:32,409 --> 00:08:33,610
he'll drive a Santana

164
00:08:33,610 --> 00:08:34,770
to the plant gate tomorrow

165
00:08:34,770 --> 00:08:35,559
to show off.

166
00:08:37,250 --> 00:08:39,010
What's wrong with giving him money?

167
00:08:39,010 --> 00:08:40,039
He's my brother.

168
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:40,490
Giving it to him

169
00:08:40,490 --> 00:08:42,169
is better than giving it to an outsider!

170
00:08:42,169 --> 00:08:42,960
Wan Yang,

171
00:08:43,610 --> 00:08:45,010
don't play dumb.

172
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,610
Have you ever cared about our family?

173
00:08:47,610 --> 00:08:49,250
Whenever you open your mouth,

174
00:08:49,250 --> 00:08:50,800
everyone has to do as you say.

175
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:51,660
What about Jun?

176
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,770
He's been helping out
without any complaints.

177
00:08:53,770 --> 00:08:54,560
He truly respects you

178
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,610
as his brother-in-law!

179
00:08:55,610 --> 00:08:56,320
What about you?

180
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,180
What about you?

181
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,080
I always thought

182
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,340
you were a smart person

183
00:08:59,370 --> 00:09:00,490
who could see the bigger picture.

184
00:09:00,490 --> 00:09:01,040
How could you be so disgraceful

185
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,370
at a crucial moment like this?

186
00:09:02,370 --> 00:09:04,100
You're just like your brother!

187
00:09:10,250 --> 00:09:11,040
Wan Yang,

188
00:09:15,130 --> 00:09:16,930
we've been married for decades,

189
00:09:18,740 --> 00:09:20,390
and this is how you see me?

190
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:35,540
Take a look at the fine wine.

191
00:10:19,010 --> 00:10:20,250
Jie, be quick.

192
00:10:20,370 --> 00:10:21,900
We've been waiting for you.

193
00:10:22,490 --> 00:10:23,680
You do this all the time.

194
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:25,010
We'll play first.

195
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:27,910
Help yourself.

196
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:28,290
Okay.

197
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,290
Okay, ship the goods.

198
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,850
Mr. Lin, the goods have been shipped.

199
00:10:33,850 --> 00:10:34,420
Look,

200
00:10:34,450 --> 00:10:35,770
go to the arranged warehouse

201
00:10:35,770 --> 00:10:37,760
and wait to receive them.

202
00:10:37,780 --> 00:10:39,170
Okay. Thank you, Department Chief Sun,

203
00:10:39,170 --> 00:10:40,400
for giving me such a good price.

204
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:41,460
Well, the money...

205
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:42,500
As usual.

206
00:10:42,530 --> 00:10:43,930
Give it to Hong's people.

207
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,250
Okay, no problem.

208
00:10:45,250 --> 00:10:45,960
Glad to work with you.

209
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,160
-Okay.
-I'm leaving.

210
00:10:47,660 --> 00:10:48,300
Okay.

211
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:54,530
We must find the real account book

212
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:56,070
to prove their crimes.

213
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:06,350
[Imperial Virtue and Divine Might]

214
00:11:03,530 --> 00:11:05,010
Sister, how is it?

215
00:11:06,610 --> 00:11:08,270
Did my brother-in-law agree?

216
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:10,150
He agreed.

217
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:11,850
Now, go to the hotpot restaurant

218
00:11:11,850 --> 00:11:13,110
and do as I say.

219
00:11:27,220 --> 00:11:28,130
Dongzi Hotpot Restaurant.

220
00:11:28,130 --> 00:11:28,770
Okay.

221
00:11:38,230 --> 00:11:38,660
Hurry.

222
00:11:38,690 --> 00:11:40,460
Sir, follow that motorcycle.

223
00:11:38,860 --> 00:11:44,100
[Wugang Taxi]

224
00:11:40,490 --> 00:11:40,970
Okay.

225
00:11:45,830 --> 00:11:47,250
[Xinghuo Mahjong Club]

226
00:11:58,400 --> 00:11:59,010
[Xinghuo Mahjong Club]

227
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:01,580
[Xinghuo Mahjong Club]

228
00:11:59,420 --> 00:12:01,530
Hong, why are you here?

229
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:02,720
The money will be delivered to you

230
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,920
in a moment.

231
00:12:04,890 --> 00:12:05,800
I'm just here

232
00:12:06,190 --> 00:12:07,590
to tell you

233
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,440
to get the amount right

234
00:12:09,470 --> 00:12:11,070
when calculating the money.

235
00:12:11,390 --> 00:12:12,520
It's not 70 percent.

236
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,290
It's 30 percent.

237
00:12:16,060 --> 00:12:17,720
Director Wan and I

238
00:12:17,750 --> 00:12:18,950
agreed on 70 percent.

239
00:12:19,490 --> 00:12:21,100
Sun Jie,

240
00:12:21,690 --> 00:12:23,080
your appetite has really grown

241
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:25,950
over the years.

242
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:27,410
Are you forcing me

243
00:12:27,410 --> 00:12:29,040
to say this?

244
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:29,800
Without Wan's help,

245
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,530
could you have made it this far?

246
00:12:31,730 --> 00:12:34,230
Don't crave what you shouldn't have.

247
00:12:34,260 --> 00:12:35,890
Is this your idea

248
00:12:37,010 --> 00:12:38,420
or Director Wan's idea?

249
00:12:40,710 --> 00:12:41,660
Questioning me?

250
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:42,960
Oh my god.

251
00:12:42,980 --> 00:12:44,780
You even dare to question me now?

252
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:46,410
Sun Jie,

253
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,250
you used to be

254
00:12:48,250 --> 00:12:49,840
merely Wan's driver.

255
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,020
Without our family,

256
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:52,250
you wouldn't even be able to touch

257
00:12:52,250 --> 00:12:52,720
the tires of a Santana!

258
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,650
Are you out of your mind?

259
00:12:53,650 --> 00:12:54,910
What's wrong with you?

260
00:12:56,680 --> 00:12:57,560
I'm sorry.

261
00:12:58,300 --> 00:12:59,970
Sorry, Hong. I shouldn't have said that.

262
00:12:59,970 --> 00:13:01,050
I crossed the line.

263
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,000
I'm so sorry.

264
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:02,550
I'm sorry.

265
00:13:02,550 --> 00:13:04,310
I'll walk you out, Hong.

266
00:13:05,300 --> 00:13:06,280
70 percent.

267
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:07,720
Not a penny less.

268
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:09,380
Don't worry, not a penny less.

269
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:16,280
Then I'll stop here, Hong.

270
00:13:19,090 --> 00:13:20,850
Take care, Hong.

271
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:35,930
Mr. Lin,

272
00:13:36,650 --> 00:13:38,410
the guy collecting money for Hong

273
00:13:38,410 --> 00:13:39,290
is in trouble.

274
00:13:39,310 --> 00:13:40,370
He's been noticed.

275
00:13:40,420 --> 00:13:41,820
Don't give him the money.

276
00:13:41,850 --> 00:13:42,610
A guy called Shui

277
00:13:42,610 --> 00:13:43,900
replaced him.

278
00:13:44,290 --> 00:13:45,100
Give it to him.

279
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:45,720
I'll send you his number

280
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,890
in a bit, okay?

281
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:47,840
Okay.

282
00:14:12,770 --> 00:14:14,140
Slow down, sir.

283
00:14:14,210 --> 00:14:15,210
No need to follow too closely.

284
00:14:15,210 --> 00:14:15,760
Okay.

285
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:22,030
Hello, Shui.

286
00:14:22,040 --> 00:14:23,020
Did you get the money?

287
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:23,960
Yes.

288
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:26,270
Okay, bring it to Pier 5 right away

289
00:14:26,290 --> 00:14:27,440
and wait for me there.

290
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,190
Okay.

291
00:14:30,690 --> 00:14:31,350
Right here.

292
00:14:32,780 --> 00:14:33,390
Okay.

293
00:14:37,310 --> 00:14:38,470
Here, thanks.

294
00:14:41,150 --> 00:14:42,740
[Renovating, Closed]

295
00:14:49,370 --> 00:14:52,770
[Renovating, Closed]

296
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:55,980
Jun, why are you here?

297
00:14:56,010 --> 00:14:56,720
Are you closed?

298
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,260
Hong said we needed to renovate.

299
00:14:58,260 --> 00:14:59,060
That's right.

300
00:14:59,510 --> 00:15:00,560
My sister

301
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,400
will come over to eat later.

302
00:15:02,520 --> 00:15:03,880
Get some food.

303
00:15:02,890 --> 00:15:05,750
[Renovating, Closed]

304
00:15:04,550 --> 00:15:05,710
Hong didn't tell me.

305
00:15:05,910 --> 00:15:07,420
She told me.

306
00:15:08,490 --> 00:15:09,170
Okay.

307
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:09,440
Go, hurry.

308
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:10,170
Okay.

309
00:15:15,830 --> 00:15:19,310
[Dongzi Hotpot Restaurant]

310
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:51,010
Did they move the plant

311
00:15:51,010 --> 00:15:52,540
to their home?

312
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,040
Not bad.

313
00:16:30,110 --> 00:16:31,110
Here's the money.

314
00:16:33,140 --> 00:16:34,870
The ship is already at the pier.

315
00:16:35,570 --> 00:16:36,660
Drive the car away.

316
00:16:37,210 --> 00:16:37,780
Okay.

317
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,050
Who are you?

318
00:17:06,329 --> 00:17:07,440
Who are you?

319
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:08,480
I'm Liu Jun.

320
00:17:09,130 --> 00:17:10,329
Liu Hong is my sister.

321
00:17:10,369 --> 00:17:11,569
My sister told me

322
00:17:11,589 --> 00:17:13,380
that I'll be in charge of transportation
from now on.

323
00:17:13,380 --> 00:17:14,180
Wait a minute.

324
00:17:14,609 --> 00:17:15,960
I'll tell my boss.

325
00:17:21,609 --> 00:17:22,760
I'll stay here.

326
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:23,950
Go back now

327
00:17:24,109 --> 00:17:24,960
and report this

328
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:26,490
to the investigation team.

329
00:17:26,849 --> 00:17:27,440
Hurry!

330
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,200
Don't let him escape.

331
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:29,200
Be careful.

332
00:17:38,290 --> 00:17:39,710
[Incoming Call] [Answer]

333
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,170
Hello?

334
00:17:42,220 --> 00:17:42,960
Director,

335
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,800
I have something to tell you.

336
00:17:44,810 --> 00:17:45,810
Go ahead.

337
00:17:46,410 --> 00:17:48,170
Liu Jun went to Dongzi Hotpot Restaurant.

338
00:17:48,170 --> 00:17:49,090
He said Hong asked him

339
00:17:49,090 --> 00:17:50,200
to take over the transportation.

340
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,050
Did you know?

341
00:17:52,170 --> 00:17:53,070
Where is he?

342
00:17:53,090 --> 00:17:54,290
He's left.

343
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:50,960
Back off!

344
00:19:50,730 --> 00:19:51,530
Don't grab it!

345
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:52,630
Put it down!

346
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:10,070
[No Swimming. It's Dangerous.
Ignore It at Your Own Risk.]

347
00:20:33,890 --> 00:20:34,720
Let go!

348
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:36,810
Let go!

349
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:02,920
[Pier 5]

350
00:21:04,890 --> 00:21:05,890
Go!

351
00:21:06,240 --> 00:21:07,110
Go! Hurry!

352
00:21:58,230 --> 00:22:00,280
Director, something terrible happened.

353
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:02,240
Chen Shan snatched the account book.

354
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:03,440
All our financial transactions

355
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:04,480
are written in it.

356
00:22:04,660 --> 00:22:05,590
It'll definitely

357
00:22:05,590 --> 00:22:06,980
fall into the hands
of the investigation team.

358
00:22:06,980 --> 00:22:08,440
There's no turning back.

359
00:22:08,460 --> 00:22:10,060
Director, what should we do?

360
00:22:25,100 --> 00:22:26,150
This is the address.

361
00:22:26,150 --> 00:22:27,750
Qi Mo is keeping an eye on him.

362
00:22:27,840 --> 00:22:29,240
Okay. Wang,

363
00:22:29,260 --> 00:22:30,240
take this.

364
00:22:30,260 --> 00:22:32,110
Take your people
to this address immediately.

365
00:22:32,110 --> 00:22:33,420
Make sure to protect the evidence.

366
00:22:33,420 --> 00:22:34,070
Yes, sir.

367
00:22:34,150 --> 00:22:34,940
Zhang,

368
00:22:35,080 --> 00:22:36,160
tell the police

369
00:22:36,180 --> 00:22:37,340
to cooperate

370
00:22:37,360 --> 00:22:38,500
and ensure everyone's safety.

371
00:22:38,500 --> 00:22:39,150
Yes, sir!

372
00:22:41,610 --> 00:22:42,430
Team Leader Pan.

373
00:22:42,430 --> 00:22:43,900
My brother said Sun Jie escaped.

374
00:22:43,900 --> 00:22:45,040
What about Wan Yang?

375
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:46,980
Go to the teahouse.

376
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:48,770
Department Chief Wang.

377
00:22:49,410 --> 00:22:50,200
Department Chief Wang.

378
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:50,850
Who is it?

379
00:22:50,850 --> 00:22:51,760
Take your men

380
00:22:51,760 --> 00:22:52,760
and come with me!

381
00:22:53,090 --> 00:22:54,020
Team Leader Pan.

382
00:22:54,040 --> 00:22:55,020
Hurry! Go!

383
00:22:55,130 --> 00:22:56,410
Go! Follow him!

384
00:22:56,410 --> 00:22:57,310
Hurry up!

385
00:23:10,020 --> 00:23:10,710
Ying.

386
00:23:11,170 --> 00:23:11,960
Shan.

387
00:23:13,410 --> 00:23:14,370
You're all here.

388
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:20,480
Ying.

389
00:23:21,900 --> 00:23:24,010
You were smart as a kid.

390
00:23:24,370 --> 00:23:26,050
I watched you grow up.

391
00:23:27,790 --> 00:23:30,690
And now you're even more clever.

392
00:23:32,640 --> 00:23:34,200
Do you think you've investigated

393
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,760
everything clearly?

394
00:23:41,540 --> 00:23:42,260
Shan.

395
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:44,920
Take good care of your sister.

396
00:23:50,980 --> 00:23:51,940
Zhang Wenying,

397
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:53,850
Chen Fu,

398
00:23:55,670 --> 00:23:57,920
you're luckier than me.

399
00:25:04,530 --> 00:25:05,160
Everyone,

400
00:25:05,780 --> 00:25:08,080
entrusted by the superiors
and the plant party committee,

401
00:25:06,270 --> 00:25:10,900
[Boost Efficiency Through Reform,
Thrive Through Technology]

402
00:25:08,180 --> 00:25:09,780
I'm making an announcement.

403
00:25:10,240 --> 00:25:12,050
The investigation team

404
00:25:11,020 --> 00:25:16,610
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas
Distribution Plant Mobilization Meeting]

405
00:25:12,050 --> 00:25:13,280
thoroughly investigated

406
00:25:13,280 --> 00:25:14,850
the Project 713 accident

407
00:25:14,870 --> 00:25:16,830
and a series of disciplinary

408
00:25:17,050 --> 00:25:18,960
and legal violations

409
00:25:19,080 --> 00:25:20,790
[Wang Hao] [Zhang Xiangyang]

410
00:25:19,130 --> 00:25:20,460
uncovered at the plant.

411
00:25:20,890 --> 00:25:22,810
The investigation findings

412
00:25:20,940 --> 00:25:25,510
[Wang Hao] [Pan Minghui] [Zhang Xiangyang]

413
00:25:22,810 --> 00:25:24,170
and the decisions on the actions

414
00:25:24,170 --> 00:25:25,850
are hereby announced as follows.

415
00:25:25,850 --> 00:25:27,380
First, it has been verified

416
00:25:27,570 --> 00:25:28,810
that Wan Yang, the former plant manager,

417
00:25:28,810 --> 00:25:31,110
embezzled state assets and accepted bribes

418
00:25:31,110 --> 00:25:32,780
during his tenure overseeing

419
00:25:32,800 --> 00:25:34,620
the construction and daily operations

420
00:25:34,620 --> 00:25:35,720
of Project 713.

421
00:25:35,500 --> 00:25:37,430
[Pan Minghui]

422
00:25:35,850 --> 00:25:36,850
The violations are serious

423
00:25:36,850 --> 00:25:37,720
and egregious in nature.

424
00:25:37,540 --> 00:25:39,900
[Wang Hao] [Zhang Xiangyang]

425
00:25:37,740 --> 00:25:40,050
Sun Jie, the former
supply department chief,

426
00:25:40,050 --> 00:25:41,770
Liu Hong, wife of Wan Yang,

427
00:25:41,790 --> 00:25:43,540
her relative Liu Jun, and others

428
00:25:43,540 --> 00:25:45,000
also participated in the crimes

429
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:46,130
to varying degrees.

430
00:25:46,130 --> 00:25:48,330
Most of the illicit funds
have been recovered,

431
00:25:48,330 --> 00:25:51,260
and relevant witness testimonies,
evidence, and documents

432
00:25:51,260 --> 00:25:53,140
have all been verified and secured.

433
00:25:53,140 --> 00:25:54,870
Second, given the above facts,

434
00:25:54,890 --> 00:25:56,720
the relevant personnel
are handled as follows.

435
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,780
Wan Yang, the principal offender,

436
00:25:57,780 --> 00:25:59,490
committed suicide out of fear of
punishment during the investigation.

437
00:25:59,490 --> 00:26:02,130
With the approval of superiors,
he is expelled from the Party

438
00:26:02,130 --> 00:26:02,960
and the plant.

439
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:05,480
All posthumous benefits are canceled.

440
00:26:05,800 --> 00:26:07,120
Accomplices Sun Jie,

441
00:26:07,140 --> 00:26:08,740
Liu Hong, Liu Jun, and others

442
00:26:08,940 --> 00:26:11,070
have been handed over
to the judicial authorities

443
00:26:11,070 --> 00:26:12,520
for severe punishment
according to the law.

444
00:26:12,520 --> 00:26:14,810
He Jianchuan,
the former construction team leader,

445
00:26:14,810 --> 00:26:17,340
and Feng Jian,
the design department deputy director,

446
00:26:17,340 --> 00:26:20,050
abused their power
and failed to report what they knew.

447
00:26:20,050 --> 00:26:22,300
They are transferred and demoted.

448
00:26:22,650 --> 00:26:24,310
After careful investigation

449
00:26:24,330 --> 00:26:25,850
and prudent consideration,

450
00:26:25,850 --> 00:26:28,130
we've decided that because Chen Fu
died in the line of duty,

451
00:26:28,130 --> 00:26:29,920
a pension of 100,000 yuan

452
00:26:30,920 --> 00:26:33,320
will be given to his family
on a chosen date.

453
00:26:33,330 --> 00:26:34,530
As for Zhang Wenying,

454
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:37,130
as the former director
of the design department,

455
00:26:37,130 --> 00:26:39,890
she failed to report and covered up

456
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:42,130
multiple cases involving Wan Yang.

457
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:44,680
All her lifetime ranks and honorary titles

458
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:45,890
are now revoked.

459
00:26:46,520 --> 00:26:48,330
In addition, according to
reports from the people,

460
00:26:48,330 --> 00:26:51,000
her daughter Chen Ying's accounting job

461
00:26:51,240 --> 00:26:52,640
in the supply department

462
00:26:52,850 --> 00:26:53,850
was also due to

463
00:26:53,850 --> 00:26:55,680
her connections.

464
00:26:56,090 --> 00:26:58,340
She is hereby dismissed.

465
00:27:00,530 --> 00:27:01,170
Wait.

466
00:27:02,690 --> 00:27:03,290
Everyone,

467
00:27:03,290 --> 00:27:05,160
this is a hard lesson.

468
00:27:05,190 --> 00:27:06,900
All cadres and workers

469
00:27:06,930 --> 00:27:08,150
must take this as a warning

470
00:27:08,150 --> 00:27:09,090
and strictly abide by

471
00:27:09,090 --> 00:27:12,110
-the national laws and regulations.
-They're corrupt.

472
00:27:12,110 --> 00:27:13,290
They deserved this.

473
00:27:14,770 --> 00:27:18,110
Now, the market-oriented
reform of the plant

474
00:27:18,140 --> 00:27:19,400
is imminent.

475
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:21,920
At this critical point,

476
00:27:22,170 --> 00:27:24,050
we need to select a new plant director

477
00:27:24,050 --> 00:27:25,940
as soon as possible.

478
00:27:27,360 --> 00:27:28,120
Ying.

479
00:27:29,130 --> 00:27:29,920
Ying.

480
00:27:33,410 --> 00:27:34,200
Well...

481
00:27:34,890 --> 00:27:35,680
Ying.

482
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:39,020
Don't worry.

483
00:27:39,040 --> 00:27:40,720
I'll explain it to

484
00:27:40,750 --> 00:27:42,080
the investigation team

485
00:27:42,170 --> 00:27:43,570
and try to persuade them.

486
00:27:44,980 --> 00:27:46,180
Thank you, Mr. Qi.

487
00:27:47,500 --> 00:27:50,100
The bad guys
got the punishment they deserved.

488
00:27:51,230 --> 00:27:52,350
In our opinion,

489
00:27:53,370 --> 00:27:55,290
getting justice for our parents

490
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:57,040
is the most important thing.

491
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:59,520
Other things don't matter to me.

492
00:28:00,100 --> 00:28:01,560
Hurry back to the meeting.

493
00:28:01,730 --> 00:28:02,750
We're going home.

494
00:28:12,100 --> 00:28:13,090
Hello, everyone.

495
00:28:13,090 --> 00:28:15,420
I'm Geng Jian, the acting plant director.

496
00:28:15,960 --> 00:28:18,610
You're working hundreds of miles away.

497
00:28:18,640 --> 00:28:20,470
And I'm always concerned about you.

498
00:28:20,470 --> 00:28:22,540
Make sure to be safe

499
00:28:23,660 --> 00:28:25,260
and take care of yourselves.

500
00:28:25,520 --> 00:28:27,090
Once I'm done with work,

501
00:28:27,090 --> 00:28:28,370
I'll go see you.

502
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:29,640
Okay. Goodbye.

503
00:28:35,240 --> 00:28:35,760
Come in.

504
00:28:37,050 --> 00:28:37,790
What's the matter?

505
00:28:37,790 --> 00:28:38,920
-Are you busy?
-Yes.

506
00:28:40,870 --> 00:28:42,820
Well, I want to talk to you.

507
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:43,810
Well,

508
00:28:44,150 --> 00:28:46,210
now that Wan Yang and Sun Jie are gone,

509
00:28:46,610 --> 00:28:49,410
there is no one
in charge of the supply department.

510
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:50,170
So, what should

511
00:28:50,170 --> 00:28:51,900
the supply department do next?

512
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:54,130
You're the top leader
and the plant director.

513
00:28:54,130 --> 00:28:55,790
Please give us some guidance.

514
00:28:56,280 --> 00:28:57,760
The new plant director

515
00:28:57,760 --> 00:28:58,890
hasn't been decided yet.

516
00:28:58,890 --> 00:29:00,550
I'm just the acting director.

517
00:29:00,630 --> 00:29:01,800
Well, about that...

518
00:29:01,820 --> 00:29:03,370
Don't be so modest.

519
00:29:03,830 --> 00:29:06,000
Didn't you hear what the leader said
at the meeting?

520
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:09,390
He said we need to select
a new director as soon as possible

521
00:29:09,410 --> 00:29:11,090
to lead the reform work.

522
00:29:11,720 --> 00:29:12,760
He also said

523
00:29:12,760 --> 00:29:14,890
the new director must have experience

524
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:17,260
and understand
the business and technology.

525
00:29:17,260 --> 00:29:19,300
Who else could it be but you?

526
00:29:20,130 --> 00:29:22,060
By the way, there's one more thing.

527
00:29:23,370 --> 00:29:24,370
A few days ago,

528
00:29:24,480 --> 00:29:25,810
someone gave my wife

529
00:29:26,090 --> 00:29:27,240
a painting,

530
00:29:27,720 --> 00:29:29,240
saying it was by

531
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:30,650
that famous painter

532
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:31,720
named Zhao Hui.

533
00:29:31,040 --> 00:29:32,720
[Gathering of Fine Traits]

534
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:32,810
Take a look.

535
00:29:33,170 --> 00:29:34,920
Chrysanthemum, orchid,
plum blossom, and bamboo.

536
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:35,850
My wife said

537
00:29:35,920 --> 00:29:38,590
it's a refined piece of art.

538
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:40,370
Then I thought

539
00:29:40,610 --> 00:29:42,330
a refined work like this

540
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:46,280
should belong to a capable person.

541
00:29:47,520 --> 00:29:48,240
Then it occurred to me

542
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:50,100
the most capable person around me

543
00:29:50,470 --> 00:29:51,740
is you, right?

544
00:29:53,760 --> 00:29:55,590
So, I quickly packed it up.

545
00:29:55,710 --> 00:29:57,730
I'll leave it here.

546
00:29:57,870 --> 00:29:58,920
Right here.

547
00:30:01,610 --> 00:30:02,720
Department Chief Gao, what are you doing?

548
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:03,720
I-I'm not doing anything.

549
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:04,480
What are you doing?

550
00:30:04,480 --> 00:30:04,850
I...

551
00:30:04,850 --> 00:30:05,810
Wan Yang just fell.

552
00:30:05,810 --> 00:30:06,480
Do you want me

553
00:30:06,480 --> 00:30:07,480
to repeat his tragedy?

554
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:08,170
I-I didn't...

555
00:30:08,170 --> 00:30:08,410
Take it back.

556
00:30:08,410 --> 00:30:09,040
That's not what I meant.

557
00:30:09,040 --> 00:30:09,440
Take it back.

558
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:10,170
That's not what I meant!

559
00:30:10,170 --> 00:30:10,610
Take it back!

560
00:30:10,610 --> 00:30:10,920
Director,

561
00:30:10,920 --> 00:30:12,330
please put it down. Put it down.

562
00:30:12,330 --> 00:30:13,280
Listen to me.

563
00:30:13,280 --> 00:30:14,090
I...

564
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:15,000
I...

565
00:30:15,610 --> 00:30:16,520
I'm not good with words.

566
00:30:16,520 --> 00:30:17,850
I mean, I'm gifting

567
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:20,760
this painting

568
00:30:21,050 --> 00:30:22,960
to the plant.

569
00:30:23,180 --> 00:30:24,330
I'm giving it to the plant.

570
00:30:24,330 --> 00:30:25,760
It belongs to the plant now.

571
00:30:25,760 --> 00:30:27,240
You're the top leader and the director.

572
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:28,330
So, you can decide

573
00:30:28,520 --> 00:30:30,650
how to use the plant's resources,

574
00:30:31,090 --> 00:30:31,920
right?

575
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:33,760
I think

576
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:35,520
in a week at most...

577
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:36,760
In a week,

578
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:39,200
the appointment will definitely be issued.

579
00:30:39,200 --> 00:30:40,240
Well, I...

580
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:41,130
on behalf of the supply department,

581
00:30:41,130 --> 00:30:42,610
I swear...

582
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:44,960
Oh, no, I'm making a statement.

583
00:30:46,090 --> 00:30:47,650
Everyone in the supply department

584
00:30:47,650 --> 00:30:49,380
is ready for the reform.

585
00:30:49,400 --> 00:30:51,800
We're just waiting for your order.

586
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:57,740
We'll deal with that when the time comes.

587
00:31:00,610 --> 00:31:01,520
But

588
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:03,130
our work can't be delayed.

589
00:31:03,130 --> 00:31:03,920
That's right.

590
00:31:03,920 --> 00:31:05,280
Department Chief Gao,

591
00:31:05,280 --> 00:31:07,280
now that you've started preparing,

592
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:08,810
you should take charge of the department

593
00:31:08,810 --> 00:31:10,370
for now.

594
00:31:10,370 --> 00:31:11,520
Wait, I...

595
00:31:11,610 --> 00:31:12,280
Also,

596
00:31:12,280 --> 00:31:13,610
we can't let

597
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:15,130
people like

598
00:31:15,330 --> 00:31:17,130
Wan Yang and Sun Jie

599
00:31:17,130 --> 00:31:17,920
disrupt our progress

600
00:31:17,920 --> 00:31:19,090
in the reform.

601
00:31:19,890 --> 00:31:20,810
Don't worry.

602
00:31:20,830 --> 00:31:22,960
I'll definitely fulfill the mission.

603
00:31:23,240 --> 00:31:24,200
I'll leave you to it.

604
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:25,090
I'm leaving.

605
00:31:56,880 --> 00:32:05,550
[September 3]

606
00:32:18,030 --> 00:32:18,620
Ying,

607
00:32:18,950 --> 00:32:20,520
why don't you wait a bit longer?

608
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:21,200
I've been

609
00:32:21,200 --> 00:32:22,570
looking for information these days.

610
00:32:22,570 --> 00:32:24,450
Let's go to the plant and fight for it.

611
00:32:24,450 --> 00:32:25,200
If it really doesn't work,

612
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:26,930
we'll look for a job elsewhere.

613
00:32:27,480 --> 00:32:29,090
Didn't you always say

614
00:32:29,090 --> 00:32:30,090
that we can't stay

615
00:32:30,090 --> 00:32:32,130
in our parents' plant forever,

616
00:32:32,410 --> 00:32:34,520
and that we have to go out
and see the world?

617
00:32:34,520 --> 00:32:35,670
Things have changed.

618
00:32:35,670 --> 00:32:37,200
The plant doesn't want me,

619
00:32:37,810 --> 00:32:39,240
so I have to look forward.

620
00:32:40,410 --> 00:32:41,720
I've thought it through.

621
00:32:41,720 --> 00:32:42,650
Once I find a job,

622
00:32:42,410 --> 00:32:45,510
[Reform and Opening Up Need Talent;
Enterprise Growth Depends on Talent]

623
00:32:42,650 --> 00:32:44,510
I can definitely support myself.

624
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:46,050
As for Guangzhou,

625
00:32:46,090 --> 00:32:47,620
you should go if you have to.

626
00:32:48,130 --> 00:32:49,410
But listen,

627
00:32:50,090 --> 00:32:51,480
if you gain a foothold there,

628
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:54,280
you must come back
and take me there with you, okay?

629
00:32:56,280 --> 00:32:56,920
Look,

630
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:58,280
with my resume,

631
00:32:58,650 --> 00:33:01,050
finding a job
will be a piece of cake, right?

632
00:33:04,090 --> 00:33:05,200
Okay, go back and wait for our reply.

633
00:33:05,200 --> 00:33:06,800
There are fewer people here.

634
00:33:09,170 --> 00:33:09,960
Hello.

635
00:33:10,570 --> 00:33:12,760
I'm looking for an accounting job.

636
00:33:14,440 --> 00:33:15,520
Chen Ying. Accounting job...

637
00:33:15,520 --> 00:33:16,200
Yes.

638
00:33:16,200 --> 00:33:17,530
Wugang Petrochemical?

639
00:33:19,090 --> 00:33:21,090
Chen Fu and Zhang Wenying...

640
00:33:21,090 --> 00:33:23,220
Are they the ones in the newspaper?

641
00:33:23,320 --> 00:33:25,610
Yes. Why is she here?

642
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:29,660
Is Zhang Wenying your mother?

643
00:33:29,740 --> 00:33:31,800
She covered up the director's crime.

644
00:33:31,810 --> 00:33:33,170
So, your family is involved

645
00:33:33,170 --> 00:33:34,500
in the recent scandal of

646
00:33:34,760 --> 00:33:36,610
Wugang Petrochemical
Gas Distribution Plant?

647
00:33:36,610 --> 00:33:37,440
Your mother covered up

648
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:38,700
the director's crime?

649
00:33:39,110 --> 00:33:41,970
-Why talking about her mother?
-Alright. Let’s go.

650
00:33:43,890 --> 00:33:45,590
It's okay. Let's talk to someone else.

651
00:33:45,590 --> 00:33:46,920
Just ignore them, Ying.

652
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:50,000
Wait a moment.

653
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:50,740
I need to take a call.

654
00:33:50,740 --> 00:33:51,330
Go ahead.

655
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:54,010
Hello.

656
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:57,280
Hello.

657
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:59,130
I'm the HR manager

658
00:33:59,130 --> 00:34:00,760
of Guangdong Petrochemical Plant.

659
00:34:00,760 --> 00:34:02,610
Is this Mr. Chen Shan?

660
00:34:03,350 --> 00:34:05,070
Yes, this is Chen Shan.

661
00:34:05,280 --> 00:34:06,280
Hello, Chen Shan.

662
00:34:06,410 --> 00:34:07,170
A month ago,

663
00:34:07,170 --> 00:34:08,400
you turned down the engineer position

664
00:34:08,400 --> 00:34:10,060
in our technical department.

665
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:11,840
It was really a pity.

666
00:34:12,090 --> 00:34:13,679
But now we have a new position

667
00:34:13,679 --> 00:34:15,199
in the engineering department.

668
00:34:15,199 --> 00:34:15,929
After review,

669
00:34:15,929 --> 00:34:17,530
you're still very suitable.

670
00:34:17,530 --> 00:34:19,199
I wonder if you'd consider

671
00:34:19,199 --> 00:34:21,270
taking the position.

672
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:23,170
I'm sorry.

673
00:34:23,810 --> 00:34:25,449
I wonder if you

674
00:34:26,010 --> 00:34:27,670
still have any

675
00:34:27,870 --> 00:34:29,989
accounting vacancies right now.

676
00:34:31,560 --> 00:34:33,170
No, not at the moment.

677
00:34:34,210 --> 00:34:35,020
No?

678
00:34:35,050 --> 00:34:35,900
That's right.

679
00:34:38,010 --> 00:34:39,610
Alright then, I won't

680
00:34:39,610 --> 00:34:41,159
take that position.

681
00:34:41,190 --> 00:34:41,880
Thank you.

682
00:34:41,969 --> 00:34:42,719
Actually,

683
00:34:42,719 --> 00:34:44,449
I only want to find a job.

684
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:46,570
How about this? Take a copy of my resume.

685
00:34:46,570 --> 00:34:47,800
My phone number is on it.

686
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:49,489
If there are any suitable jobs,

687
00:34:49,489 --> 00:34:50,969
please call me, okay?

688
00:34:50,989 --> 00:34:51,550
Okay.

689
00:34:51,580 --> 00:34:52,330
Thanks.

690
00:34:56,489 --> 00:34:57,420
Team Leader Pan.

691
00:34:58,720 --> 00:35:00,050
You were looking for me?

692
00:35:00,570 --> 00:35:01,280
Mr. Qi.

693
00:35:01,490 --> 00:35:02,170
We received

694
00:35:02,170 --> 00:35:03,760
your reform proposal.

695
00:35:04,170 --> 00:35:06,930
Many of your ideas are very interesting.

696
00:35:06,950 --> 00:35:08,120
Conflicts and disagreements

697
00:35:08,120 --> 00:35:10,720
are inevitable during
the reform of a company.

698
00:35:11,680 --> 00:35:12,810
What's your opinion

699
00:35:12,990 --> 00:35:13,870
on that?

700
00:35:14,010 --> 00:35:15,530
Right now, our plant is like

701
00:35:15,530 --> 00:35:17,440
an old ship stranded
in the tide of reform.

702
00:35:17,440 --> 00:35:18,460
If we don't transform,

703
00:35:18,460 --> 00:35:19,810
we will only sink.

704
00:35:19,980 --> 00:35:22,540
Personnel integration
and position streamlining

705
00:35:22,540 --> 00:35:24,460
will definitely be a hard process.

706
00:35:24,460 --> 00:35:25,330
But this is also

707
00:35:25,650 --> 00:35:27,760
the necessary path
to break through the dilemma.

708
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:30,070
To completely fix the long-rooted problems
and turn the tables,

709
00:35:30,070 --> 00:35:32,530
we must boldly break out
of our old patterns.

710
00:35:33,460 --> 00:35:34,130
Great.

711
00:35:35,330 --> 00:35:36,510
Mr. Qi, thank you so much

712
00:35:36,510 --> 00:35:38,370
for practical ideas and honesty.

713
00:35:38,680 --> 00:35:39,990
I've already submitted

714
00:35:39,990 --> 00:35:41,650
your proposal to the leaders.

715
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,390
Thank you.

716
00:35:43,980 --> 00:35:44,690
Well...

717
00:35:45,050 --> 00:35:45,820
Team Leader Pan,

718
00:35:45,820 --> 00:35:47,470
about Chen Ying,

719
00:35:47,650 --> 00:35:48,650
I want to have a brief talk

720
00:35:48,650 --> 00:35:49,760
with you.

721
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,050
As far as I know,

722
00:35:51,090 --> 00:35:52,030
she was fully prepared

723
00:35:52,030 --> 00:35:53,620
for her transfer.

724
00:35:53,940 --> 00:35:55,690
It's not the kind of nepotism

725
00:35:55,720 --> 00:35:57,010
you think it is.

726
00:35:57,050 --> 00:35:58,010
And this position...

727
00:35:58,010 --> 00:35:58,490
Mr. Qi,

728
00:35:58,490 --> 00:35:59,650
we've already

729
00:35:59,680 --> 00:36:01,140
reached a conclusion on this.

730
00:36:01,140 --> 00:36:03,140
Let's not discuss it further,

731
00:36:03,170 --> 00:36:03,850
okay?

732
00:36:10,220 --> 00:36:11,660
-Sir, I put it in.
-Okay.

733
00:36:15,450 --> 00:36:17,200
-What’s wrong?
-It's hot. Be careful.

734
00:36:17,200 --> 00:36:17,930
Here you go.

735
00:36:17,930 --> 00:36:18,650
Thanks.

736
00:36:19,050 --> 00:36:20,280
Look at these stalls.

737
00:36:20,300 --> 00:36:21,830
Their business is booming.

738
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:26,250
If I really can't find a job,

739
00:36:26,630 --> 00:36:27,960
I'll also set up a stall.

740
00:36:28,360 --> 00:36:29,170
Ying,

741
00:36:29,940 --> 00:36:31,610
no matter what you do,

742
00:36:31,630 --> 00:36:32,550
count me in.

743
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:33,890
I'm strong.

744
00:36:35,650 --> 00:36:37,430
You're strong?

745
00:36:37,450 --> 00:36:38,370
Let's go.

746
00:36:40,610 --> 00:36:42,010
Set up a stall.

747
00:36:45,150 --> 00:36:46,280
Put this here.

748
00:36:46,470 --> 00:36:47,470
Do you want socks?

749
00:36:48,910 --> 00:36:52,920
[Socks]

750
00:36:49,220 --> 00:36:50,220
Do you want socks?

751
00:36:50,640 --> 00:36:51,550
No.

752
00:36:53,070 --> 00:36:54,020
Sit down.

753
00:36:54,260 --> 00:36:55,050
No need.

754
00:36:57,240 --> 00:36:58,050
Ying,

755
00:36:58,280 --> 00:37:00,280
it's okay to set up a stall,

756
00:37:00,690 --> 00:37:03,310
but do we have to do it at the plant gate?

757
00:37:03,800 --> 00:37:05,540
There are so many familiar people.

758
00:37:05,540 --> 00:37:08,070
I'm afraid they might say
bad words about you.

759
00:37:08,210 --> 00:37:09,460
The more familiar the place is,

760
00:37:09,460 --> 00:37:09,940
the better you know

761
00:37:09,940 --> 00:37:11,670
when there are more customers.

762
00:37:11,950 --> 00:37:12,870
Besides,

763
00:37:13,370 --> 00:37:14,090
selling socks

764
00:37:14,090 --> 00:37:15,620
isn't something shameful.

765
00:37:17,090 --> 00:37:18,610
Put this in the front.

766
00:37:18,630 --> 00:37:20,740
Ying, you should take a break.

767
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:22,080
I'll go get some food.

768
00:37:22,310 --> 00:37:23,400
Take a break.

769
00:37:27,680 --> 00:37:31,290
[Socks]

770
00:37:29,290 --> 00:37:30,310
Not bad.

771
00:37:31,080 --> 00:37:33,680
You're doing business
right at the plant gate.

772
00:37:35,400 --> 00:37:36,410
Do you want socks?

773
00:37:37,720 --> 00:37:38,530
For this kind,

774
00:37:38,530 --> 00:37:39,170
1 yuan a pair,

775
00:37:39,170 --> 00:37:40,430
1.5 yuan for two pairs.

776
00:37:41,570 --> 00:37:43,450
If you had chosen me,

777
00:37:44,090 --> 00:37:46,220
you wouldn't have to suffer like this.

778
00:37:47,620 --> 00:37:49,100
I make my own living,

779
00:37:49,580 --> 00:37:50,850
unlike some people

780
00:37:51,380 --> 00:37:52,840
who always cling to others

781
00:37:53,330 --> 00:37:54,490
like stinky socks

782
00:37:54,510 --> 00:37:55,910
that can't be shaken off.

783
00:37:58,710 --> 00:38:00,710
Which socks are the most expensive?

784
00:38:01,980 --> 00:38:03,040
Knee-high socks.

785
00:38:03,250 --> 00:38:04,530
The black ones,

786
00:38:04,550 --> 00:38:06,350
and the ones in the plastic bags.

787
00:38:08,500 --> 00:38:09,540
These socks...

788
00:38:10,880 --> 00:38:12,270
Is the quality good?

789
00:38:13,640 --> 00:38:15,280
Here's a piece of advice.

790
00:38:15,310 --> 00:38:17,590
Whether working in
a state-owned enterprise

791
00:38:17,590 --> 00:38:19,360
or doing a small business,

792
00:38:19,730 --> 00:38:21,990
you have to make sure the quality is good.

793
00:38:24,680 --> 00:38:26,180
These socks are terrible.

794
00:38:26,210 --> 00:38:27,350
They get holes so easily.

795
00:38:27,350 --> 00:38:28,440
It's not going to work.

796
00:38:28,440 --> 00:38:29,990
People have to pay.

797
00:38:30,120 --> 00:38:30,570
Look,

798
00:38:30,590 --> 00:38:32,720
who wants to buy torn socks like these?

799
00:38:34,720 --> 00:38:35,530
Thank you.

800
00:38:37,050 --> 00:38:38,710
Quality is what matters most.

801
00:38:47,730 --> 00:38:48,990
Shan! Shan!

802
00:38:49,350 --> 00:38:50,600
Shan! Shan!

803
00:38:50,620 --> 00:38:51,620
-Shan!
-Stop!

804
00:38:52,470 --> 00:38:54,390
Ying, he's picking on you again!

805
00:38:55,980 --> 00:38:56,820
Shan.

806
00:38:57,320 --> 00:38:58,200
I know

807
00:38:58,460 --> 00:38:59,720
you want to protect me.

808
00:39:01,770 --> 00:39:02,820
But right now,

809
00:39:03,730 --> 00:39:05,530
I only hope you can stay safe.

810
00:39:05,590 --> 00:39:07,120
Don't cause trouble again.

811
00:39:10,650 --> 00:39:12,810
Eat up. The popsicle is melting.

812
00:39:19,950 --> 00:39:21,490
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution
Plant Review and Summary Conference]

813
00:39:24,240 --> 00:39:25,220
Director Geng,

814
00:39:25,400 --> 00:39:26,930
the celebration banquet

815
00:39:26,930 --> 00:39:28,200
is ready.

816
00:39:28,430 --> 00:39:29,490
After the meeting,

817
00:39:29,680 --> 00:39:31,650
we'll go to the private room
at Songhe Restaurant.

818
00:39:31,650 --> 00:39:32,900
Private Room 2.

819
00:39:32,650 --> 00:39:34,970
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution
Plant Review and Summary Conference]

820
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:34,000
Okay.

821
00:39:34,030 --> 00:39:34,950
Stop talking.

822
00:39:42,630 --> 00:39:44,320
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution
Plant Review and Summary Conference]

823
00:39:48,210 --> 00:39:49,090
Hello, everyone.

824
00:39:49,090 --> 00:39:50,990
Following deliberation
by the factory Party committee

825
00:39:50,990 --> 00:39:52,550
and approval
by the higher-level Party committee,

826
00:39:51,590 --> 00:39:58,610
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution
Plant Review and Summary Conference]

827
00:39:52,580 --> 00:39:54,860
I am hereby authorized to announce

828
00:39:55,260 --> 00:39:56,690
the appointment of the plant director

829
00:39:56,690 --> 00:39:58,620
during the restructuring period.

830
00:39:59,010 --> 00:40:00,820
To deepen the reform
of state-owned enterprises

831
00:40:00,820 --> 00:40:02,820
and optimize the leadership structure,

832
00:40:02,820 --> 00:40:04,100
in accordance with
the Wugang Petrochemical

833
00:40:04,100 --> 00:40:05,120
Gas Distribution Plant

834
00:40:05,120 --> 00:40:06,570
Director Work Regulations

835
00:40:06,570 --> 00:40:08,430
and the spirit of the opinions
on deepening the reform

836
00:40:08,430 --> 00:40:09,600
of the personnel system

837
00:40:09,600 --> 00:40:10,630
of state-owned enterprises,

838
00:40:10,630 --> 00:40:12,330
after research and decision
by the CPC Wugang Petrochemical

839
00:40:12,330 --> 00:40:14,490
Gas Distribution Plant Party Committee,

840
00:40:14,490 --> 00:40:16,720
and with the approval
of the superior Party committee,

841
00:40:14,510 --> 00:40:18,140
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution
Plant Review and Summary Conference]

842
00:40:16,880 --> 00:40:19,280
we're making the following appointments.

843
00:40:20,200 --> 00:40:20,970
Comrade Geng Jian...

844
00:40:20,970 --> 00:40:22,500
-Great!
-Great!

845
00:40:22,530 --> 00:40:23,600
-Great!
-Great!

846
00:40:27,890 --> 00:40:29,030
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution
Plant Review and Summary Conference]

847
00:40:33,110 --> 00:40:34,240
Comrade Geng Jian

848
00:40:34,260 --> 00:40:36,830
will continue to serve
as the deputy director.

849
00:40:36,830 --> 00:40:38,370
We're appointing Comrade Qi Mo

850
00:40:38,370 --> 00:40:40,540
as the director
of the Wugang Petrochemical

851
00:40:40,540 --> 00:40:41,450
Gas Distribution Plant,

852
00:40:41,450 --> 00:40:43,930
fully in charge of the enterprise's
production, operation,

853
00:40:43,930 --> 00:40:45,040
technology research and development,

854
00:40:45,040 --> 00:40:46,360
market-oriented reform,

855
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:48,140
and internal control management.

856
00:40:48,140 --> 00:40:50,290
The term of office starts today,

857
00:40:50,320 --> 00:40:51,380
lasting three years.

858
00:40:51,380 --> 00:40:52,010
Great!

859
00:40:54,550 --> 00:40:57,030
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution
Plant Review and Summary Conference]

860
00:40:56,990 --> 00:40:58,570
Comrade Qi Mo, your reform plan

861
00:40:58,570 --> 00:40:59,570
is excellent.

862
00:40:59,980 --> 00:41:00,980
I hope you can

863
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:02,870
act as you said and thought that day,

864
00:41:02,870 --> 00:41:04,320
and lead our plant

865
00:41:04,340 --> 00:41:05,570
into a new era!

866
00:41:05,590 --> 00:41:07,800
-Great!
-Great!

867
00:41:10,510 --> 00:41:13,740
Now let's invite Director Qi Mo

868
00:41:13,950 --> 00:41:16,390
to the stage and say a few words.

869
00:41:16,420 --> 00:41:17,110
Okay!

870
00:41:26,780 --> 00:41:29,700
This appointment is really a surprise.

871
00:41:30,240 --> 00:41:32,840
But now that the leaders

872
00:41:33,240 --> 00:41:34,750
have entrusted me
with this heavy responsibility,

873
00:41:34,750 --> 00:41:37,880
I'll certainly live up
to their expectations

874
00:41:38,340 --> 00:41:40,540
and lead our plant to embrace the reform

875
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:42,410
and write a brand-new chapter!

876
00:41:42,570 --> 00:41:43,700
Thank you, leaders,

877
00:41:43,880 --> 00:41:44,930
and thank you all.

878
00:41:47,010 --> 00:41:47,880
Five years ago,

879
00:41:48,280 --> 00:41:50,480
you said someone in your family was sick

880
00:41:50,820 --> 00:41:53,070
and borrowed 20,000 yuan from Finance.

881
00:41:53,090 --> 00:41:54,820
You still haven't paid it back.

882
00:41:55,180 --> 00:41:56,780
I never mentioned it

883
00:41:56,130 --> 00:41:57,240
[IOU]

884
00:41:57,700 --> 00:42:00,030
and even helped you cover up the accounts.

885
00:42:01,840 --> 00:42:02,840
Three years ago,

886
00:42:02,930 --> 00:42:04,660
you were arrested

887
00:42:04,680 --> 00:42:06,480
for soliciting at a dance club.

888
00:42:06,500 --> 00:42:07,860
I paid and pulled strings

889
00:42:07,860 --> 00:42:09,170
to get you out.

890
00:42:09,490 --> 00:42:11,710
This is the detention warrant
from that time.

891
00:42:10,620 --> 00:42:12,170
[Decision on Early Release by the
Wugang County Public Security Bureau]

892
00:42:13,260 --> 00:42:14,920
I was the one who picked you up.

893
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:17,070
No one else knows.

894
00:42:17,680 --> 00:42:18,600
A year ago,

895
00:42:18,910 --> 00:42:20,740
you went to the north on a business trip.

896
00:42:20,740 --> 00:42:22,580
At the dinner table,
you got a little drunk

897
00:42:22,580 --> 00:42:24,270
and groped a saleswoman.

898
00:42:24,290 --> 00:42:25,770
She came straight to me,

899
00:42:26,310 --> 00:42:28,110
threatening to report you
for sexual assault.

900
00:42:28,110 --> 00:42:29,720
I paid another 20,000 yuan

901
00:42:29,810 --> 00:42:31,870
[Receipt]

902
00:42:30,190 --> 00:42:31,750
to keep her silent.

903
00:42:31,780 --> 00:42:33,710
This is the receipt from that time.

904
00:42:41,610 --> 00:42:42,340
Boss.

905
00:42:44,310 --> 00:42:45,980
What do you mean?

906
00:42:47,240 --> 00:42:48,440
I only want to tell you

907
00:42:49,310 --> 00:42:51,840
that you have to help me
persuade your senior.

908
00:42:51,900 --> 00:42:53,770
As long as she doesn't turn herself in,

909
00:42:53,770 --> 00:42:56,250
I'll return all these things to you.

910
00:42:56,410 --> 00:42:57,200
Moreover,

911
00:42:57,500 --> 00:42:58,930
I'll retire early,

912
00:42:59,950 --> 00:43:01,980
and you'll be the plant director.

913
00:43:09,370 --> 00:43:10,160
In addition,

914
00:43:10,940 --> 00:43:12,170
Comrade Geng Jian

915
00:43:12,190 --> 00:43:13,880
has done his best

916
00:43:14,240 --> 00:43:16,450
and made great contributions

917
00:43:16,850 --> 00:43:18,090
during his time as the acting director.

918
00:43:18,090 --> 00:43:20,570
Now, let's welcome
Deputy Director Geng Jian

919
00:43:20,570 --> 00:43:22,640
to come on stage and say a few words!

920
00:43:22,660 --> 00:43:23,220
Okay!

921
00:43:38,090 --> 00:43:39,940
I didn't make

922
00:43:39,970 --> 00:43:40,820
great contributions

923
00:43:40,820 --> 00:43:42,070
as the leader

924
00:43:43,610 --> 00:43:45,330
Actually,

925
00:43:45,870 --> 00:43:47,110
I also agree

926
00:43:47,140 --> 00:43:49,100
that Qi Mo is

927
00:43:49,840 --> 00:43:52,350
the most suitable candidate

928
00:43:52,380 --> 00:43:53,910
for the director position.

929
00:43:54,310 --> 00:43:55,750
He's got solid foundations

930
00:43:55,750 --> 00:43:57,200
and understand the technology.

931
00:43:57,200 --> 00:43:59,730
-That's how unpredictable life is.
-I believe that under

932
00:43:59,730 --> 00:44:02,780
-You never know who'll be the next winner.
-Director Qi's leadership, our factory

933
00:44:02,780 --> 00:44:05,820
will enjoy an even brighter
and more prosperous future!

934
00:44:05,820 --> 00:44:06,880
Congratulations!

935
00:44:48,910 --> 00:44:59,300
[September 3, 1997]
